            "text": "Dot Node — Branch Routing\n\nDot node acts as a pass-through routing point.\nSame LFO signal split into two branches:\n• Math (x2 gain) → top output\n• Filter (smoothed) → bottom output\nDot adapts to any family — works with TOP, SOP, DAT too.",
